  "notes": "Near-black pro-tool UI (Electron 43) for motion previs. Panels are bordered (#273035, 7px radius) cards on slightly lighter surfaces. Blue (#2f6fd6-ish) marks active stepper steps, selected radio card outline and checked control-layer tiles; cyan #74e8f2 is used for credit links; neon green for status/positive ratings; salmon red for Cancel. Export presets are letter-avatar toggle tiles (S/C/B/R/K) in brand colours. Most controls are disabled while analysis runs. Number steppers with -/+ buttons for Temporal Window/Max People. The SHOT input in the left panel overflows its column (layout clipping). Camera Path view overlays a camera icon and perspective grid on the video."
